        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b0bf8b7e60f64b55257c34e4f6dfd09f.poster.avif?t=1779240977\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b0bf8b7e60f64b55257c34e4f6dfd09f.webm?t=1779240977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b0bf8b7e60f64b55257c34e4f6dfd09f.mp4?t=1779240977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are H.P. LoveCraft's cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You were named something unforgivable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stole the Necronomicon, a powerful magical book..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You time-traveled to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bought the fattest gat on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now? Revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cultist, shoggoth, and elder god pays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring goofy and hilarious full fledged cutscenes one for each of the 5 bosses. <br> <br>Works on controller! Even Steam Deck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>NOTE:</u></i> </strong><br><strong>The game, music, and assets don't use AI.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Assets in Game: CocoDayo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Song by Rapper: Tony Tig  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes: Acmes #1 Customer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poster Art: SemajZ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Game Dev: Mr. Dapperton</p>",
